# SSH public keys for the meltingplot account.
#
# meltingplot is the account Raspberry Pi Connect runs as. It holds no
# privileges: no sudo, no access to the printer's files, plugins or hardware.
# Root is for the administrator, whose keys are in mpadmin.keys.
#
# The keys land in the home directory, which moves to the persistent partition
# when an image is made and which no update touches afterwards. A change here
# therefore reaches a printer only when its medium is flashed, never by update.
#
# Public keys only. Never put a private key or an auth key in this repository -
# it is public.
#
# One key per line, e.g.
# ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3Nza... tim@meltingplot.net
